Gym Management System - Project Documentation
1. Introduction
The Gym Management System is a Salesforce-based CRM application designed to automate gym operations. The application reduces manual work by automatically creating memberships, assigning trainers, generating workout plans, managing payments, and providing real-time dashboard analytics.
________________________________________
2. Objectives
•	Automate gym member registration
•	Reduce manual data entry
•	Manage memberships efficiently
•	Assign trainers automatically
•	Track payments
•	Monitor business performance through dashboards
•	Improve operational efficiency
________________________________________
3. System Modules
Member Module
Stores:
•	Personal Information
•	Contact Details
•	Join Date
•	Workout Type
•	Membership Type
•	Assigned Trainer
________________________________________
Membership Module
Stores:
•	Membership Type
•	Membership Fee
•	Discount
•	Duration
•	Start Date
•	End Date
•	Status
________________________________________
Trainer Module
Stores:
•	Trainer Information
•	Specialization
•	Assigned Members
________________________________________
Workout Plan Module
Stores:
•	Workout Type
•	Member
•	Duration
•	Active Status
________________________________________
Payment Module
Stores:
•	Membership
•	Amount
•	Payment Date
________________________________________
4. Salesforce Automation
Apex Triggers
Member Trigger
Before Insert
•	End Date Calculation
•	Date Validation
•	Trainer Assignment
After Insert
•	Membership Creation
•	Workout Plan Creation
________________________________________
5. Dashboard Features
The dashboard provides:
•	Total Members
•	Total Trainers
•	Total Memberships
•	Total Revenue
•	Recent Members
•	Recent Payments
•	Membership Distribution Chart
•	Revenue Chart (In Progress)
