9. Conclusion
The Gym Management System demonstrates how Salesforce CRM can be customized using Apex, Lightning Web Components, automation, and interactive dashboards to solve real-world business problems. The project combines CRM functionality, business process automation, and modern UI components to create an efficient and scalable gym management solution while providing valuable insights through real-time analytics.

